/T (Let dist[v] be the shortest distance currently known from the source to city v. Initially, dist[source] = 0 and all other distances are infinity. For an edge \(u, v\) with weight w, update dist[v] when dist[u] + w is smaller than the current value. Set parent[v] = u whenever an improvement is found. Blocked roads are skipped during edge relaxation.)
/E (Let dist[v] be the shortest distance currently known from the source to city v. Initially, dist[source] = 0 and all other distances are infinity. For an edge \(u, v\) with weight w, update dist[v] when dist[u] + w is smaller than the current value. Set parent[v] = u whenever an improvement is found. Blocked roads are skipped during edge relaxation.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
